// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INTRO :
"P1639419657" "<color red>{DEFEAT_BOSS_VILLAIN_GROUP_TEXT}</color><br><br>So, to business, eh {HeroName}? We've got a bit o' trouble with those Talons of Vengeance. They're just wrecking everything that we're doing 'ere in Night Ward.<br><br>If you can give us a hand by wiping out one of their caves, we'll see to it that you're rewarded quite well in wax, or whatever else you'd like to be paid in."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INTRO :
"P3262028616" "<color red>Black Knights</color><br><br>Those clangers insist on getting involved in <i>everyone's</i> business. They make it difficult for us t' make an 'onest day's living. If you're not careful, {HeroName}, they'll be barking up your tree, too!<br><br>Tell you what. They just finished wiping out those Talon birdies. I'll tell you where they are, and you can wipe the whole lot o' them out! I'll even throw in some wax for you t' use, as you'll be doing us all a favor for this."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INTRO :
"P3290031574" "<color red>Midnight Masters</color><br><Br>Those Midnight Master blokes are a little on the irritating side, what with being undead and all that. There's not a lot o' profit in going after them, but they <i>can</i> cause us some hang ups during our collections... and they definitely don't belong 'ere in Night Ward.<br><br>Tell you what, {HeroName}, a bunch of those undead folks just wandered into one o' the caverns belonging to the Talons. If you can take 'em out, we'll give you a hearty payment in whatever you want."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_SEND_OFF :
"P719062827" "Good luck, {HeroName}, give those troublemakers a what for! Your payment will be awaiting you once the task is finished."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ENTRY_STRING :
"P3454339865" "You step into the lair of the Talons of Vengeance. The stench of blood is heavy in the air."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ENTRY_STRING :
"P1587664837" "The Black Knights made quick work of the Talons in these caves."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ENTRY_STRING :
"P552103447" "You can hear the shambling of the Midnight Masters up ahead."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_TASK_SUCCESS :
"P1365060938" "You've defeated the Talons of Vengeance!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_TASK_SUCCESS :
"P3313145613" "You defeated the Black Knights!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_TASK_SUCCESS :
"P604155379" "You defeated the Midnight Masters!"
// Script Variable BOSS_NAME :
"P4163493360" "Head Oracle"
// Script Variable BOSS_NAME :
"P3569295924" "Head Templar"
// Script Variable BOSS_NAME :
"P3977623634" "Powerful Archmage"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INACTIVE :
"P4039489080" "Those Drudges are mere pawns to be tossed away in our conquest of Night Ward."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INACTIVE :
"P1621306530" "We're almost done here. Let's keep moving."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INACTIVE :
"P1758646075" "Foul magics lurk in the area. Be on your guard."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ACTIVE :
"P1984957793" "{HeroName}! You will not stand in our way!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ACTIVE :
"P1459628583" "{HeroName}! Do you dare strike at the Black Knights?"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ACTIVE :
"P1845757393" "{HeroName}?"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_INACTIVE :
"P4010612417" "First Ward was a loss, but we shall ensure that justice prevails in Night Ward."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_INACTIVE :
"P1254533482" "The Talons know where we stand now."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_INACTIVE :
"P472955418" "The Talons are down, now it is time for us to collect their magic."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_ACTIVE :
"P1646604613" "You will be the first of many to die, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_ACTIVE :
"P4169354371" "Do you attack us out of anger, {HeroName}, or is it out of greed?"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_ACTIVE :
"P813519021" "Don't get in our way, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_INACTIVE :
"P3478012818" "There is much work to be done, sisters, but we shall thwart whoever stands in our way."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_INACTIVE :
"P3117058230" "No mercy, remember that. The Talons will destroy us all."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_INACTIVE :
"P1159698183" "Night Ward is safer, for the moment."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_ACTIVE :
"P1839241264" "You will not stop us, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_ACTIVE :
"P431411381" "Perhaps you are the next threat we must handle, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_ACTIVE :
"P1204045587" "We spoke too soon!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_GROUP1_INACTIVE :
"P856364347" ""
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_GROUP2_INACTIVE :
"P545728860" "Night Ward shall be ours, and then we shall ensure no soul escapes our grasp!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_GROUP2_ACTIVE :
"P470994963" "You cannot stop our power!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INTRO_OFFICE :
"P3671239370" "<color red>Spirit Stalkers</color><br><br>Those dogs known as the Spirit Stalkers cause us no end of problems. Case in point, they made off with a batch o' perfectly fine humans, souls and all! Now, those humans are all dead now, and we've lost out on a prime payment.<br><br>We'll pay you very well, {HeroName}, if you could go take care o' this pack for us. They've absconded into one of the nearby offices. Shadow Hunter needs t' know that he can't stand in between a Drudge and his money, eh?"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INTRO_OFFICE :
"P1617542076" "<color red>Apparitions</color><br><br>Th' Apparitions... ah, they're an interesting lot, I'll tell you that much. If only they were just a little <i>more</i> than just hateful balls of energy... if only they had souls! There is something we can do about that, however.<br><br>There's this theory o' mine, that if enough pain is caused to an apparition, the host might just feel it. At the very least, we'll be able to see a link to where this apparition was originally from.<br><br>So! I'm telling you all of this to request you take down a group of these folks, that way myself and my fellow gentlemen can find us some hearty souls for th' taking! We'll even cut you in on the payment we receive. "
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INTRO_OFFICE :
"P463696873" "<color red>Midnight Masters</color><br><Br>Look alive, {HeroName}! We've got ourselves a problem. The Midnight Masters are gathering in a nearby office t' form some sort of spell that can <i>bind</i> the Drudges to specific areas! Now, I'd handle this myself, but, well, what with the' whole being bound to one place, it would be a bad idea.<br><br>If you can stop them, we'll be grateful to you, and by grateful, I mean send a payment t' you for your services."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ENTRY_STRING_OFFICE :
"P1737760773" "You step over pieces of torn apart clothing belonging to the innocent civilians, killed by the Spirit Stalkers."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ENTRY_STRING_OFFICE :
"P2655005666" "The Apparitions lie in wait to trap any innocents that might be wander in here. They'll be in for a rude surprise when they see you."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ENTRY_STRING_OFFICE :
"P3620246875" "Chaotic magic sparks throughout the air of this office building."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_TASK_SUCCESS_OFFICE :
"P1370826500" "You defeated the Spirit Stalkers!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_TASK_SUCCESS_OFFICE :
"P3765281939" "You defeated the Apparitions!"
// Script Variable BOSS_NAME_OFFICE :
"P555124098" "Pack Leader"
// Script Variable BOSS_NAME_OFFICE :
"P3143582368" "Hateful Spectre"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P647148166" "BRING THEM ALL! TEAR THEM DOWN!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P2483116450" "The Drudges have become drunk with greed."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P626416638" "TEAR... THEM... DOWN...!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P1669616042" "{HeroName}? Are you working for those monsters?"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P1870233845" "TRAITORS! LIARS! ALL OF THEM!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P2449537269" "We must begin our attack against the Drudges."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_ACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P2384365128" "YOU WILL NOT TRICK ME AGAIN!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_ACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P3908270807" "You cannot stop this, {HeroName}, it is for the good of Night Ward!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P3802554133" "THE LOVE WAS NOT REAL!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P3583795920" "We should pity the Drudges and what they've become."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_ACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P2659722800" "YOU WILL FEEL MY PAIN!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_ACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P844254433" "There is no pity for you, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INTRO_TECH :
"P4174962628" "<color red>Talons of Vengeance</color><br><br>Look alive, {HeroName}. I'm not terribly sure how you would look, given my whole eye situation, however.<br><br>Those birdies in the Talons just wiped out a group of our boys. Now, they were on a <i>very</i> big job that had a lot o' promise for wax. That's all gone now, which means we need t' make those birdies <i>pay</i>.<br><br>We'll give you a fine payment if you can take out the Talons that attacked our boys, show 'em that the Drudges don't take kindly t' our payment being interrupted."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INTRO_TECH :
"P914100456" "<color red>Black Knights</color><br><br>The clangers sent one o' their scouting parties into an old lab in Night Ward.<br><br>Now, {HeroName}, this might sound petty, but I really just want all of those clangers t' go die in a fire, eh? They're always gettin' in our way, tellin' us that we're unethical or not concerned with the well-bein' of Night Ward. Who are they t' decide?<br><br>If you can go and take care o' this scouting party, we'll send you a lovely payment for your services. "
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ENTRY_STRING_TECH :
"P1079722361" "The Drudges don't really seem to take kindly to getting their money taken away, but you noticed Cromwell didn't care for the lives of his comrades."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ENTRY_STRING_TECH :
"P1373645346" "The Drudges seem willing to do whatever it takes to make some quick money. Or wax."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_TASK_SUCCESS_TECH :
"P4039901986" "You defeated the Talons of Vengeance!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P4023112556" "The Drudges are just the first of many to feel our anger!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P400672080" "Be on your guard. The apparitions are gone, but they may still be around."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P3543570777" "You are next, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P3409641458" "{HeroName}? Why are you here?"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P3038269593" "Those fools were pathetic. They cannot hope to stand against the Carrion Feast!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P3390492115" "Night Ward grows more chaotic each day. The Apparitions... the Drudges..."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P1974764636" "You believe you can stop us, {HeroName}?"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS2_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P2118876723" "You're not making the situation any better, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P3200566819" "The Drudges are doomed. We shall feast on all of them!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P4045902642" "We must find a final solution to the problem of Night Ward."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P2296628966" "Why get in our way, {HeroName}?"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS3_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P2775336809" "You will be the first we take out, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_GROUP1_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P3974609112" "Those greedy fools will not be able to withstand our full power."
// Script Variable DEFEAT_BOSS_GROUP2_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P3827071739" "They exist solely for their own greed. They shall be wiped out."
// Script Variable MISSION2_INTRO_TECH :
"P4154220221" "<color red>{MISSION2_VILLAINGROUP_TECH_TEXT}</color><br><br>Them Talons o' Vengeance birdies have kidnapped one o' the clangers, {HeroName}. Now, we don't normally do the whole swoop in and rescue deal. Well, actually, we don't do that at all. This is more o' those kidnap someone from the group that already has 'em kidnapped.<br><br>If you would be so kind as t' go beat down these Talons, swipe the Black Knight that they have, and steal the treasure they're hording, we would be most grateful, in the form o' a generous payment."
// Script Variable MISSION2_INTRO_TECH :
"P712173037" "<color red>Spirit Stalkers</color><br><br>That Shadow Hunter bloke is bad for business, {HeroName}. Case in point. We found out there was a thrump-thrump here in Night Ward, soul and all! Bad news is that his little monsters absconded with the thrumper, leaving us high and dry.<br><br>We've gotta show Shadow Hunter who runs the show around here, {HeroName}, and by we, I mean you, who will be paid quite well. Mind picking up a thrump thrump for us while taking down this pack leader o' Shadow Hunters? You can even steal any sorta valuable tech in the lab they're in for yourself!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_INTRO_TECH :
"P1328539627" "<color red>Apparitions</color><br><br>We're drawing the line in the proverbial sand with the Apparitions, {HeroName}.<br><br>They've kidnapped one o' our boys, along with his payment. Now, I know they did it because o' the whole uncontrollable rage angle, and maybe they're not t'o responsible for their actions. I <i>know</i> that. However, <i>I don't care</i>. We need you t' go in there, rough up the Apparitions, get our man back, and his payment. You do that and we'll send a nice bit o' payment your way."
// Script Variable MISSION2_ENTRY_TECH :
"P2924376545" "The missing knight is in here somewhere, along with {MISSION2_BOSS_NAME_TECH}."
// Script Variable MISSION2_ENTRY_TECH :
"P1721616793" "The Spirit Stalkers have surrounded a the civilian somewhere within this lab."
// Script Variable MISSION2_ENTRY_TECH :
"P3877141316" "You can see marks on the ground from combat. The Drudge must have fought hard against the Apparitions."
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_NAME_TECH :
"P2616455311" "Kalia"
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_NAME_TECH :
"P1126581370" "Powerful Spectre"
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P392602694" "We will make the Black Knight into one of our own!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P3376081590" "KILL... YOU... ALL... MURDER... VENGEANCE...!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P1519385928" "You cannot stop our goals, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P250320562" "TEAR YOU APART!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_NAME_TECH :
"P3560083137" "Sir Hufrem"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_NAME_TECH :
"P563971456" "Stranded Civilian"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_NAME_TECH :
"P3365998152" "Taskmaster"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P3544040791" "You shall not get away with this!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P1770400670" "Get away from me you beasts!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P438249638" "This is just incredibly annoying."
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P4291197635" "What are you doing here?"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P3066119026" "Help! Over here!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P2450734504" "I hear an outsider. Are you working with Cromwell?"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_THANKS_TECH :
"P1977191035" "Where are you taking me? You fiend!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_THANKS_TECH :
"P582533547" "Thank you so... wait... where am I going?!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_THANKS_TECH :
"P2583630958" "That old dog! I'll have to thank him when I see the magnificent bloke."
// Script Variable MISSION2_VILLAIN_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P593795845" "Your knights will not save you, not now, not ever."
// Script Variable MISSION2_VILLAIN_INACTIVE_TECH :
"P3706521506" "DIE! DIE! BLOOD! ANGER! FURY!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_VILLAIN_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P4015969730" "Why are you here, {HeroName}?!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_VILLAIN_ACTIVE_TECH :
"P3345396808" "YOU DIE NOW!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_GLOWIE_NAME_TECH :
"P2635313110" "Black Knight Treasure"
// Script Variable MISSION2_GLOWIE_NAME_TECH :
"P2263315697" "Valuable Technology"
// Script Variable MISSION2_GLOWIE_NAME_TECH :
"P2451008798" "Drudge Payment"
// Script Variable MISSION2_INTRO_WAREHOUSE :
"P1804640063" "<color red>Spirit Stalkers</color><br><br>This is unbelievable! {HeroName}, this is <i>unbelievable</i>. Those Spirit Stalkers have made o'f with one o' our boys! It's a fight they want, it's a fight they'll get. From you, o' course, I'm not one for the whole fighting deal.<br><br>Take down those dogs, get our boy back, and steal anything that might look nice in the area. For yourself, o' course."
// Script Variable MISSION2_INTRO_WAREHOUSE :
"P3877030296" "<color red>Midnight Masters</color><br><br>Those Midnight Master blokes are doing some strange experiments on the Animus Arcana. Now, I had me an idea, {HeroName}, o' a way the Drudges could use these bits o' magic t' help out in our soul collecting. So, how about we do this. I'll tell you the location where they're keeping the Animus Arcana. All you have t' do is go in there, bust the heads in o' some Midnighters, and recover that Animus Arcana for us. Th' Midnighters are going t' have some special items st'red in there, so take whatever you want for yourself. How's that sound?"
// Script Variable MISSION2_ENTRY_WAREHOUSE :
"P3304369596" "You can hear the Spirit Stalkers running around in the warehouse, growling and waiting for a challenge."
// Script Variable MISSION2_ENTRY_WAREHOUSE :
"P3710953842" "You can feel a sort of magical pull in this area. The Midnight Masters must be using this to attract the Animus Arcana."
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_NAME_WAREHOUSE :
"P3662339686" "Schimo"
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_INACTIVE_WAREHOUSE :
"P2470566747" "We need to find a way to control and protect the magic here."
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_ACTIVE_WAREHOUSE :
"P1500730682" "{HeroName}! Stay away!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_NAME_WAREHOUSE :
"P2031860512" "Captured Drudge"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_NAME_WAREHOUSE :
"P1957966595" "Ball of Light"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_WAREHOUSE :
"P4049633552" "'Oy! Let me go you hoofs! I got work to do and wax to earn!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_WAREHOUSE :
"P4271685285" "Wow! What are you guys going to do next? This sure is fun, I'm excited!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_ACTIVE_WAREHOUSE :
"P120618006" "What's that? An outsider?"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_ACTIVE_WAREHOUSE :
"P1538071200" "Oh, this is so cool! There are more people showing up!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_THANKS_WAREHOUSE :
"P773431148" "Always knew Cromwell was on the up and up!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_THANKS_WAREHOUSE :
"P4095457471" "I'll see what you and your friends have to do!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_VILLAIN_INACTIVE_WAREHOUSE :
"P3607059145" "You're a cheerful little thing, aren't you?"
// Script Variable MISSION2_VILLAIN_ACTIVE_WAREHOUSE :
"P635386202" "You won't get this magic, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_GLOWIE_NAME_WAREHOUSE :
"P1191910280" "Spirit Chest"
// Script Variable MISSION2_GLOWIE_NAME_WAREHOUSE :
"P719911946" "Midnighter Artifact"
// Script Variable MISSION2_INTRO_TUNNELS :
"P1504528851" "<color red>Talons of Vengeance</color><br><br>We've got t' act fast, {HeroName}. The Talons have one o' their transformed people here in Night Ward. Those citizens have <i>just</i> th' right combination o' darkness and purity in their souls t' make some <i>real</i> big wax for us.<br><br>We'll send a lovely payment your way if you would be so kind as t' go retrieve this lady and take down their Head Oracle. Oh, and if you could recover th' remains o' the last Drudge that went there, that would be great. He should have a report on whatever is left o' him about where he kept the wax that he was paid recently. "
// Script Variable MISSION2_INTRO_TUNNELS :
"P2775167846" "<color red>Apparitions</color><br><br>We've got ourselves a winner, {HeroName}! No time for explanations, th' Apparitions somehow have a <i>live</i> Seer 'ere in Night Ward! I'm frothing at th' mouth just THINKING about how much wax she's worth.<br><br>We'll pay you very well if you can recover that seer and find out 'ow exactly the Apparitions lured her int' Night Ward!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_ENTRY_TUNNELS :
"P242413823" "You can see drag marks on the ground, formed by the unwilling captives of the Talons."
// Script Variable MISSION2_ENTRY_TUNNELS :
"P1815686593" "Something very powerful must have brought this Seer here."
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_INACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P884581314" "We'll take many more before the day is over."
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_INACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P3085923990" "DIE! SHE MADE THE CHOICE!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_ACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P1824161324" "The armies must be full for the feast!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_BOSS_ACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P3348956977" "YOU PAY THE PRICE!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_NAME_TUNNELS :
"P501004888" "Transformed Citizen"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_NAME_TUNNELS :
"P244901103" "Seer"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P118439948" "Filled with... such... hate...!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P3514462294" "..."
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_ACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P3327988619" "What is going on...?"
// Script Variable MISSION2_HOSTAGE_THANKS_TUNNELS :
"P1308868640" "I... I don't know what's happening to me."
// Script Variable MISSION2_VILLAIN_INACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P1203352080" "DIE! THE ORIGINATOR! DIE!"
// Script Variable MISSION2_GLOWIE_NAME_TUNNELS :
"P2086521475" "Drudge Remains"
// Script Variable MISSION2_GLOWIE_NAME_TUNNELS :
"P648659700" "Sigil"
// Script Variable MISSION3_INTRO_CAVES :
"P1279613085" "<color red>Spirit Stalkers</color><br><br>We've got a bit of a problem, {HeroName}. We found out that th' Midnight Masters have an item containing a <i>large</i> number of pure souls. Only problem is that th' Spirit Stalkers have taken over the cave where they're keeping it!<br><br>We'll pay you quite well if you can beat down those Spirit Stalkers and recover that chest o' souls for us."
// Script Variable MISSION3_INTRO_CAVES :
"P463304946" "<color red>Black Knights</color><br><br>We've got ourselves a little plan, {HeroName}. We want t' disarm the Black Knights a bit, stop 'em from hamperin' our own operations.<br><br>We've got the location of where they're holding some of their weapons. Mind going in there and swiping them for us? We will, o' course, give you a suitable payment for your services."
// Script Variable MISSION3_INTRO_CAVES :
"P1270966498" "<color red>Midnight Masters</color><br><br>One o' our boys found out that the Midnight Masters have some interesting books on tracking down souls, {HeroName}. So, I decided, if we had that, it would make it <i>that</i> much easier for us t' bring in more wax on a daily basis.<br><br>Are you up for a little search in a cave nearby? All you need t' do is pick up the book, rough up some of those undead blokes, and then collect your payment!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_ENTRY_CAVES :
"P1903950436" "Do the Spirit Stalkers even realize the prize that they're sitting on?"
// Script Variable MISSION3_ENTRY_CAVES :
"P1864747291" "The Black Knights should have set up a more secure area to keep their weapons."
// Script Variable MISSION3_ENTRY_CAVES :
"P4253846049" "The Midnight Masters must have a good reason for keeping these books away from the mansion."
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_NAME_CAVES :
"P3220952396" "Moce"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_NAME_CAVES :
"P335956130" "Lead Templar"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_INACTIVE_CAVES :
"P2892050066" "We need to get these weapons out to the others."
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_INACTIVE_CAVES :
"P1316363756" "We can use this magic for ourselves, perhaps to give new life to our bodies."
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_ACTIVE_CAVES :
"P4230439688" "{HeroName}! To arms!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_ACTIVE_CAVES :
"P3130141760" "We need this, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_NAME_CAVES :
"P1055011722" "Pote"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_NAME_CAVES :
"P222747248" "Quartermaster"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_NAME_CAVES :
"P1805559100" "Desperate Archmage"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_INACTIVE_CAVES :
"P3196004547" "We've got plenty here for another party to use."
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_INACTIVE_CAVES :
"P2830920631" "I need a new soul... I can feel my own humanity slipping away..."
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_ACTIVE_CAVES :
"P180337395" "Do not let {HeroName} take the weapons!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_ACTIVE_CAVES :
"P470059883" "You won't stop me from reclaiming my humanity!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_GLOWIE_NAME_CAVES :
"P1994387302" "Box of Souls"
// Script Variable MISSION3_GLOWIE_NAME_CAVES :
"P3746173378" "Black Knight Weapons"
// Script Variable MISSION3_GLOWIE_NAME_CAVES :
"P1127034082" "Midnighter Books"
// Script Variable MISSION3_INTRO_OFFICE :
"P3308838990" "<color red>Talons of Vengeance</color><br><br>Th' Talons of Vengeance recovered the remains o' one of their elders recently. Our boys heard that they're trying to revive her. Now, I don't care much at all for that, but I figure having those remains would give us a bit o' leverage over the Talons.<br><br>{HeroName}, someone like you would be able to bust in there, bash th' Talons, and swipe those remains. We'll give you a hefty payment for this, o' course, and you'll be sure to instill fear into th' fearless Talons. ... I think."
// Script Variable MISSION3_INTRO_OFFICE :
"P2613212729" "<color red>Spirit Stalkers</color><br><br>We recently found th' spirit of a powerful hunter, {HeroName}. We're talking major spirit, major wax. However, Shadow Hunter and his Spirit Stalkers have made off with th' crystal th' spirit was being kept in!<br><br>You need to recover that crystal for us; it would mean enough wax to keep our candles lit for a long time! In exchange, we'll be happy t' give you proper payment for this."
// Script Variable MISSION3_ENTRY_OFFICE :
"P3742198202" "The Drudges are playing a dangerous game, trying to hold something over the Talons of Vengeance."
// Script Variable MISSION3_ENTRY_OFFICE :
"P2033094144" "How exactly is Shadow Hunter planning on using this crystal?"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_NAME_OFFICE :
"P1866171810" "Spiritual Oracle"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_NAME_OFFICE :
"P2801341328" "Arva"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P1235118847" "She can be revived, sisters! We can find a way!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_ACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P2582381270" "You will not stop the return of our sister!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_NAME_OFFICE :
"P647374400" "Ethereal Oracle"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_NAME_OFFICE :
"P2426559655" "Gliming"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_INACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P2285791167" "The feast requires more! We must find a way to return her!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_ACTIVE_OFFICE :
"P913771808" "You will feel our fury, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_GLOWIE_NAME_OFFICE :
"P365438177" "Elder's Remains"
// Script Variable MISSION3_GLOWIE_NAME_OFFICE :
"P2023057685" "Hunter's Spirit"
// Script Variable MISSION3_INTRO_TUNNELS :
"P3342556546" "<color red>Spirit Stalkers</color><br><br>Word is that th' Spirit Stalkers are looking for some sort o' spear in the tunnels beneath Night Ward. Now, these dogs have caused us nothing but trouble. I figure, if we can nab that item, we can use it as leverage against that Shadow Hunter fella. What do you say, {HeroName}?"
// Script Variable MISSION3_INTRO_TUNNELS :
"P1223693768" "<color red>Apparitions</color><br><br>A bunch o' Apparitions just killed an entire group of Black Knights. Very nice, eh? Now, I think we can make ourselves a little profit off o' this. The Black Knights were having a memorial for one of their fallen, boo-hoo and all that. If you can swoop in there and steal the valuables from that memorial, you can make off with a good amount of precious items.<br><br>The Drudges can use this period of mourning t' get some more jobs done, meaning more wax for us, and more money for you!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_INTRO_TUNNELS :
"P225300625" "<color red>Drudges</color><br><br>Sometimes we need t' put our own in their place, {HeroName}. Case in point, a group of Drudges just stole a large number of wax from some dear friends of mine. I promised that I would look into the scenario and get it back for them.<br><br>I'm asking you, as the powerful person you are, t' retrieve the wax and deliver an unholy punishment t' th' Drudges who did this."
// Script Variable MISSION3_ENTRY_TUNNELS :
"P1731567650" "You'll have to retrieve this spear before Shadow Hunter and his beasts do!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_ENTRY_TUNNELS :
"P1094553071" "The Apparitions are allowing their blind hate to consume them and the Black Knights that were at this memorial."
// Script Variable MISSION3_ENTRY_TUNNELS :
"P4207196828" "The Drudges ambition for wax has caused them to be blinded to any form of reason."
// Script Variable MISSION3_SUCCESS_TUNNELS :
"P114947659" "You defeated the Drudges!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_NAME_TUNNELS :
"P3938516366" "Raet"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_NAME_TUNNELS :
"P179021137" "Vengeful Spectre"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_NAME_TUNNELS :
"P2800555557" "Greedy Taskmaster"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_INACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P2481852954" "NO REST! NOT FOR THE KNIGHTS! NOT FOR ANYONE! NOT UNTIL THERE IS JUSTICE!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_INACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P2145951860" "It's in 'ere somewhere, gentlemen."
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_ACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P4013201632" "YOU WILL NOT STOP MY JUSTICE! MY! JUSTICE!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS_ACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P3939401006" "An outsider! Why is this never simple?"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_NAME_TUNNELS :
"P918895628" "Velo"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_NAME_TUNNELS :
"P2675132786" "Head Taskmaster"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_INACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P3511787570" "DESTROY! EVERYTHING!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_INACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P2972107456" "Those arrogant little... keeping th' payment from US?"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_ACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P2715954710" "DESTROY YOU!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_BOSS2_ACTIVE_TUNNELS :
"P483159124" "I can smell you, outsider!"
// Script Variable MISSION3_GLOWIE_NAME_TUNNELS :
"P300027664" "Ancient Spear"
// Script Variable MISSION3_GLOWIE_NAME_TUNNELS :
"P182856494" "Black Knight Memorial"
// Script Variable MISSION3_GLOWIE_NAME_TUNNELS :
"P3567274626" "Drudge's Wax"

